    "description": "Personal preset - the 'zz' prefix sorts it last in the preset lists. Fast 0.30 mm process for the X2D 0.6 nozzle. A 0.62 x 0.30 mm line is 0.186 mm2, so the matching 'zz Generic PLA Fast @BBL X2D 0.6 nozzle' filament ceiling of 30 mm3/s caps the real speed at ~161 mm/s. Speeds are set just under that so the slicer uses them instead of silently capping: inner wall and solid/sparse infill 160, outer wall 130, gap fill 150, first layer 80 walls / 120 infill at 1000 mm/s2. If the hotend flows more, raise the filament volumetric speed and these speeds together."
